# assistente utile U12 (docs/plans/assistente-utile.md) — una quantita' per
# periodo, per quanti periodi: tre pezzi del turno e la conversione della durata
# con quantity/3, tutto in KB (numeric-questions.p0 §4).
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test a monthly saving over years converts the duration]
!timeout 30
> If I save 50 euros a month, how much will I have in two years?
< 1200 euros.

[test the same over months, and a daily cost over weeks]
!timeout 30
> I save 50 euros every month. How much do I save in 24 months?
< 1200 euros.
> I spend 3 euros a day on coffee. How much do I spend in 2 weeks?
< 42 euros.

[test mix 13x08 a quantity per thing, times the number of things asked]
!timeout 30
> how many legs do three spiders have?
< 24 legs: 3 spiders with 8 legs each.
> how many days are in two weeks?
< 14 days: 2 weeks with 7 days each.
> how many legs does a spider have?
<~ 8 legs

[test mix 13x15 power, hours and price have roles, not a bag of numbers]
!timeout 30
> how much does it cost to run a 2000 watt heater for 3 hours at 0.25 euros per kwh?
< 1.5 euros: 6 kWh at 0.25 per kWh.
> how many kwh does a 2000 watt heater use in 3 hours?
< 6 kWh: 2000 watts for 3 hours.
<! 1997
